Mercurial extension which allows using
working copies that contain filenames longer
than Windows MAXPATH of 260 characters.

For full documentation see:
https://www.mercurial-scm.org/wiki/Win32LongFileNamesExtension

Development:

To run the tests:

set PYTHONPATH=C:\src\hg;c:\src\win32lfn\src
python c:\src\win32lfn\tests\testwin32lfn.py


